   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Outside in the courtyard, Timur accidentally bumps the fleeing inspector with his van. Brought back inside, the furious inspector demands five hundred thousand dollars to forget the ordeal and write a glowing review.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "chef",
   "t": "Тимур, ты что тут наделал?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "inspector",
   "t": "Брат, ты только не переживай!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "inspector",
   "t": "Я его не сильно сбил.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "inspector",
   "t": "Это просто ужасная гостиница!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
